{"title":"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/b/eebec73682ee99a98c52fa25bbc2bb5099159df3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{1-\\frac{x-1}{x}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"82\" height=\"43\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/728162a664f010d5edd46010bf31b192ab353be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } -x\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } x\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\sqrt{\\frac{x}{2}}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } x\\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"430\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/4/6f440769ae10911a3a67abd4091e83deaf969235.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{1-\\frac{x-1}{x}}} =  \\sqrt{\\frac{x}{\\frac{x}{x}-\\frac{x-1}{x}}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{x}{\\frac{x-(x-1)}{x}}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{x}{\\frac{1}{x}}} = \\sqrt{x^2} = |x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"450\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe5171d12590c039febe41d825de142fb541d1f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0,|x|= \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"172\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To confirm the answer, inputting a negative value into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> may help. For the ease of computation, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc52914d6fade6cb0f0f830a05d31585700f7ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1ce1c4184d653e998ed2daa4c689464447f27d52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{-3}{1-\\frac{4}{3}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{-3}{\\frac{-1}{3}}}=\\sqrt{9}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"217\" height=\"56\" />. As no other option choice fits, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f149fb4712625574c8c8be416567e6ea5d25b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" /> is the correct solution. \nNote: If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> was chosen, C would have fit as well. Make sure to avoid making this mistake.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B\">2006 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Probl